<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Pekelink — Todos tus links en un solo lugar</title>
<meta name="description" content="Pekelink: crea tu minisite tipo link-in-bio y códigos QR que redirigen a tus PDFs, catálogos y redes, todo en un solo link." />
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0b0b12;
    --card: #15151f;
    --accent: #7c5cff;
    --accent2: #22d3ee;
    --text: #f5f5f7;
    --muted: #9b9bab;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% -10%, rgba(124,92,255,0.35), transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 90% 0%, rgba(34,211,238,0.25), transparent 40%),
                var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 24px 6vw;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.3rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .logo span { color: var(--accent2); }
  nav a.cta {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .hero {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 64px 6vw 48px;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 3.6rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .hero h1 .grad {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }
  .hero p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
  }
  .hero-ctas { display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
    padding: 15px 30px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    padding: 15px 30px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .preview {
    max-width: 320px;
    margin: 56px auto 0;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px -20px rgba(124,92,255,0.35);
  }
  .preview .avatar {
    width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
  }
  .preview h3 { text-align: center; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .preview p.sub { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .preview .link-row {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 13px 16px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  section.features {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 80px auto;
    padding: 0 6vw;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { section.features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 28px;
  }
  .feature-card .icon { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .feature-card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .feature-card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .cta-band {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto 90px;
    padding: 48px 6vw;
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 24px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .cta-band h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .cta-band p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 24px; }
  footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 32px 6vw 48px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  footer a { color: var(--accent2); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">Peke<span>link</span></div>
    <nav><a class="cta" href="mailto:hola@pekelink.com">Crear mi Pekelink</a></nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Todos tus <span class="grad">links</span>, QR y catálogos<br/>en un solo lugar</h1>
    <p>Pekelink es tu página link-in-bio: un minisite con todos tus enlaces, y códigos QR que redirigen directo a tus PDFs, catálogos o redes sociales.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="mailto:hola@pekelink.com">Crear mi Pekelink gratis</a>
      <a class="btn-secondary" href="https://link.pekelink.com/demo">Ver demo</a>
    </div>

    <div class="preview">
      <div class="avatar"></div>
      <h3>Tu Negocio</h3>
      <p class="sub">link.pekelink.com/tu-negocio</p>
      <div class="link-row">📄 Catálogo / Menú (PDF)</div>
      <div class="link-row">📷 Instagram</div>
      <div class="link-row">🛒 Tienda online</div>
      <div class="link-row">📱 WhatsApp</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="icon">🔗</div>
      <h3>Minisite tipo link-in-bio</h3>
      <p>Una página con tu marca, logo y todos tus enlaces importantes, lista para compartir en redes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="icon">🔳</div>
      <h3>Códigos QR inteligentes</h3>
      <p>Generá un QR que redirige directo a tu PDF, catálogo, menú o cualquier destino — ideal para impresos.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="icon">⚡</div>
      <h3>Listo en minutos</h3>
      <p>Sin apps que instalar, sin complicaciones. Mandanos tu info y tu Pekelink está en línea el mismo día.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="cta-band">
    <h2>¿Listo para tu Pekelink?</h2>
    <p>Escribinos y armamos tu minisite + QR personalizado.</p>
    <a class="btn-primary" href="mailto:hola@pekelink.com">Empezar ahora</a>
  </div>

  <footer>
    © <%= year %> Pekelink · <a href="https://link.pekelink.com/demo">Ver un ejemplo</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
